<<investigateicon>><<link [[将古董悉数整理，把酒窖改造成隐秘安全的避风港 (0:25)|MP Quest Orphanage Cellar Ending 1]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestCellar to 7>><<set $mpQuestCellar_ending to 1>><</link>>
