:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending Select [nobr]
<<effects>>
随着最后一层线索浮出水面，所有的脉络都已经清晰地摆在你面前。四周静悄悄的，唯有你自己的呼吸声在耳畔回响，一切都将由你此刻的决断画下句点。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[将古董钟表悉数建档，成为钟表铺的幕后合伙人 (0:25)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 1]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpQuestClocktower_ending to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[将孤品秘器秘密拍卖给暗巷富商，换取巨额暗金 (0:25)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 2]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpQuestClocktower_ending to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<brothelicon>><<link [[保留钟楼顶层的私密空间，在报时钟声下尽享欢愉 (0:25)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 3]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpQuestClocktower_ending to 3>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[与伴侣在钟楼露台共赏暮色，互赠定情怀表 (0:25)|MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 4]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestClocktower to 7>><<set $mpQuestClocktower_ending to 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 1 [nobr]
<<effects>>
你将这批珍贵的古董钟表交由老匠人妥善修复展出。老匠人将店铺的分红与最高级别的古董鉴定权交到了你手中。
<<stress -18>><<trauma -12>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 150>>
<<money 2500>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 2 [nobr]
<<effects>>
你在夜色中主持了一场小范围的私密拍卖，富商们为争夺那几件孤品争相竞价，让你一举收获了丰厚的黑市资金。
<<skulduggery 10>><<gskulduggery>>
<<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 150>>
<<money 4000>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 3 [nobr]
<<effects>>
<<promiscuity2>>
每当整点的钟声轰鸣回荡，钟楼顶层的玻璃窗后便掩映着交叠缠绵的身影，轰鸣的钟声彻底掩盖了一切羞人的喘息。
<<stress -15>><<arousal 1500>><<lstress>><<ggarousal>>
<<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 70>>
<<money 2200>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Ending 4 [nobr]
<<effects>>
夕阳西下，你与伴侣在钟楼最高处交换了修复如初的对表。无论时间如何流转，你们的心跳始终同步。
<<stress -20>><<trauma -15>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 100>>
<<run window.dolmp && window.dolmp.notifyRomanceDelta && window.dolmp.notifyRomanceDelta(2, 2, -10, -2, 0, "与你共同见证了长支线的终局")>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Quest HighStreet Clockshop Epilogue [nobr]
<<effects>>
你再次来到这处曾留下深刻回忆的地方。尘埃落定之后，这里依然留存着属于你的隐秘痕迹。
<<if !$daily or !$daily.mpQuestClocktower_epilogue>>
	<<set $daily.mpQuestClocktower_epilogue to 1>>
	<<stress -8>><<trauma -4>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<<if ($mpQuestClocktower_ending or 1) is 2 or ($mpQuestClocktower_ending or 1) is 3>>
		<<set $blackmoney to ($blackmoney or 0) + 20>>
		<br><br>你在约定的暗格里取走了今日份留存的一小包赃物。
	<<else>>
		<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 20>>
		<br><br>你在隐秘的角落里又清理出了一件成色不错的旧物。
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开|($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>


