:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Ending Select [nobr]
<<effects>>
随着最后一层线索浮出水面，所有的脉络都已经清晰地摆在你面前。四周静悄悄的，唯有你自己的呼吸声在耳畔回响，一切都将由你此刻的决断画下句点。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[守护古圣所的宁静，将古董圣器交由博物馆妥善珍藏 (0:25)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Ending 1]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 7>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb_ending to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[将黄金香炉与宝石圣爵秘密转手，换取丰厚暗金 (0:25)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Ending 2]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 7>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb_ending to 2>><</link>>
<br>
