<br>
<<loveicon>><<link [[与伴侣在古水殿的泉池边交换誓约指环 (0:25)|MP Quest Temple Catacomb Ending 4]]>><<pass 25>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb to 7>><<set $mpQuestCatacomb_ending to 4>><</link>>

:: MP Quest Temple Catacomb Ending 1 [nobr]
<<effects>>
你将部分重复的古银器交由博物馆收藏，保留了水殿的纯净。每当你内心受到创伤时，来此掬水静思总能重获安宁。
<<stress -18>><<trauma -12>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
<<set $antiquemoney to ($antiquemoney or 0) + 150>>
<<money 2200>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[继续|($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

